        <div class="takeaway"><strong>Narrative Pathway:</strong> Kenema exemplifies a hybrid top-down and bottom-up Matryoshka dynamic. Local fears during the Ebola crisis generated rumours that were later codified, amplified and legitimised by foreign state-linked actors.</div>
